---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const formEndpoint = 'https://formspree.io/f/xdajdvlz';
---

<BaseLayout title="Bring Us Into Your World" description="Submit essays, notes, links, observations, civic concerns, moral questions, and difficult realities for thoughtful consideration.">
  <main class="prose reading">
    <div class="kicker">Submissions</div>
    <h1>Bring Us Into Your World</h1>

    <p>
      The internet is loud. Most people are rewarded for certainty, outrage, speed, and performance.
      We are more interested in thoughtful friction, difficult questions, and the quiet things people cannot stop thinking about.
    </p>

    <p>
      The thing you cannot stop thinking about. The pattern nobody seems to notice. The story unfolding quietly in your town.
      The question keeping you up. The essay you are not sure anyone will read. The concern you cannot shake.
    </p>

    <p>
      We welcome thoughtful submissions, essays, notes, links, observations, civic concerns, moral questions, and difficult realities.
      You do not need to be polished. You do not need to be famous. You do not need credentials.
      You only need sincerity, thoughtfulness, and a willingness to think honestly.
    </p>

    <p>
      Submission does <strong>not</strong> guarantee publication, response, endorsement, investigation, sharing, or follow-up.
      Some things may be read quietly. Some may shape future essays. Some may remain private. Some, with permission, may eventually find a public home.
    </p>

    <p>
      Either way, thank you for trusting us enough to bring us into your world.
      We do not take that lightly.
    </p>

    <form class="submission-form" action={formEndpoint} method="POST">
      <input
        type="hidden"
        name="_redirect"
        value="https://brianreymore.com/submission-received/"
      />
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New BR.com Submission" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" />

      <label>
        Name <span>(optional)</span>
        <input type="text" name="name" />
      </label>

      <label>
        Email <span>(optional, but helpful)</span>
        <input type="email" name="email" />
      </label>

      <label>
        What are you sending?
        <select name="submission_type" required>
          <option value="">Choose one...</option>
          <option>Essay</option>
          <option>Observation</option>
          <option>Local Issue</option>
          <option>Civic Concern</option>
          <option>Link / Resource</option>
          <option>Story</option>
          <option>Question</option>
          <option>Something I Can’t Stop Thinking About</option>
          <option>Other</option>
        </select>
      </label>

      <label>
        Title / Subject
        <input type="text" name="title" required />
      </label>

      <label>
        Your submission
        <textarea
        name="submission"
        rows="12"
        required
        placeholder="Write or paste your essay, concern, observation, question, local issue, story, or something you cannot stop thinking about..."
      ></textarea>
      </label>

      <label>
        Links / sources <span>(optional)</span>
        <textarea name="links" rows="5"></textarea>
      </label>

      <div class="checks">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="may_contact" value="yes" /> You may contact me about this submission.</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="anonymous_ok" value="yes" /> If referenced publicly, I prefer to remain anonymous.</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="may_quote_or_reference" value="yes" /> You may quote, reference, or build upon this submission in future work, with editorial discretion.</label>
      </div>

      <p class="notice">
        By submitting material, you acknowledge that submission does not create any obligation, partnership,
        confidentiality, representation, publication rights, or expectation of response. We reserve full editorial discretion.
      </p>

      <button type="submit">Submit for Consideration</button>
    </form>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
